  "_comment": "Curated, human-reviewed per-batch manifest for scripts/whistlebird_migration.py. One record per global VAT number. Each batch is one execution of its product workflow; 'steps' carries the real date of each production step with a per-step confidence (clean | resolved_by_context | derived). 'derived' means no separate event date was recorded for that step -- it inherits the nearest recorded step's date and is flagged as derived on the loaded row. Never auto-regenerated from the live sheet; edit here, then --confirm-reset-whistlebird-test and --rebuild-whistlebird-test to replay. See docs/whistlebird-production-import.md and docs/whistlebird-import-decisions.md.",
